OL,3,GNEWSADrugs running was like 'a paper
OL,4,Around' for exploited son, mum says
OL,5,
OL,6,FDuring that time, she said he was put
OL,7,Fat risk of continued exploitation
OL,8,Fbecause he was housed in accommodation
OL,9,Fshe considered unsuitable.
